// 289's spinning wheels (skill_crafting/configs/spinning/spinning_wheels.loc)
// on 2011's: the locs named Spinning wheel that spin on op2, as 289's do, in
// cache 786 (Daemonheim's spin on op1). 289's spinningwheel (2644, 2011's
// spinning_wheel) and viking_spinningwheel (4309) keep their ids. Their
// examines moved here from examine.loc; 37476, which had none, takes 289's.
// 289's forceapproach is the client's, so it is left to the cache.

